FR1 — View Clubs
The system shall allow university community members to view a list of verified clubs.
FR2 — Search for Clubs
The system shall allow users to search for clubs using relevant criteria such as club name, category, or keywords.
FR3 — View Club Information
The system shall allow users to view information about a selected club, including its description, activities, and designated contact information.
FR4 — Register a Club
The system shall allow authorized representatives of affiliated clubs to submit a club registration.
FR5 — Verify Club Registration
The system shall allow authorized administrative staff to review and approve or reject submitted club registrations.
FR6 — Request Venue or Facility
The system shall allow authorized club representatives to submit requests for university venues and facilities for approved club activities.
FR7 — Allocate Venue and Time
The system shall allow authorized administrative staff to approve venue requests and allocate an available venue and time based on the club's requirements.
FR8 — Manage Club Information
The system shall allow authorized SRC members or administrators to add, update, or remove club information where permitted.
FR9 — Display Club Activities
The system shall allow users to view upcoming approved activities associated with clubs.
FR10 — Notify Users
The system shall notify subscribed or relevant users about upcoming club activities.
FR11 — Display Contact Information
The system shall allow users to access the designated contact information of verified club leaders.
FR12 — Inter-club Communication
The system shall allow authorized club representatives to communicate with other registered clubs through the platform.
